# Tests
tests/**/output.json
tests/**/package-lock.json
tests/fixtures/**/*
# ... except the hand-authored lab fixtures, which are source: the committed goldens are
# generated from them, so an ignored copy would make them unreproducible.
#
# Matched by name rather than listed one by one. Every lab directory ends in `lab`, so
# `*lab` covers both `lab` itself and the `<feature>-lab` family, and a new lab is tracked
# the moment it is created. Listing them individually made this the file every parallel
# branch appended to, and so the file every merge conflicted in.
#
# The directory line must come before the contents line: git will not re-include a path
# whose parent directory it has already excluded, and `tests/fixtures/**/*` excludes the
# lab directories themselves.
!tests/fixtures/*lab/
!tests/fixtures/*lab/**
tests/fixtures/*lab/node_modules/*
# ... except a lab's own hand-authored dependencies, which are source for the same reason the
# lab is. A multi-package lab installs nothing: the dependency is a `<name>lab` directory
# committed where the compiler's module resolution looks for it, so the group a declaration
# lands in is decided by the same path rule an npm install would produce. The contents line
# above excludes the entries rather than the directory, so these two re-include both.
!tests/fixtures/*lab/node_modules/*lab/
!tests/fixtures/*lab/node_modules/*lab/**
# ... and except the pins, which are the tracked half of every npm rung: the install is
# untracked, so the version it was generated against has to be written down somewhere.
!tests/fixtures/pins.json

# Vendored microsoft/TypeScript AST generator sources, fetched by
# `dotnet fsi tools/generate-wire.fsx sync tsc-ast` and verified against the per-file
# digests in tools/tsc-ast/upstream.lock.json. The lock is committed; the tree is not.
tools/tsc-ast/upstream/

# Obsolete pre-Wire work parked under .archive/ (see .archive/README.md). The sources
# are committed so nothing is lost; the build artifacts and scratch piles are not.
.archive/scratch/
.archive/tests/Xantham.EndToEnd/fixtures/
.archive/tests/Xantham.EndToEnd/output/
.archive/tests/Xantham.EndToEnd/verify/
*.fs.js.map
